config CHARYBDIS_VBUS_POWER
    bool "Use common RGB idle policy and nRF52840 VBUS sleep control"
    depends on SOC_NRF52840 && ZMK_RGB_UNDERGLOW
    help
      RGB turns off when idle regardless of the power source. VBUS
      prevents deep sleep on both halves while USB power is present.
      Manual RGB on/off and saved lighting settings are preserved.
